Thanks for the feedback. I think the issue is that currently in Rattle I'm making very simple assumptions - a corpus consists of all files in a supplied folder (as you have found out). It really needs to be worked on to be more flexible to work with your situation - I'll have to have a look at it as time permits but for now we are stuck with the current assumption.

Regards,
Graham

